# Who is the painter painting? Velázquez's Las Meninas
tags: ["art history","velazquez","las meninas","perspective","royal portraiture","baroque painting"]
thumb: "band \"Who is he painting?\" picture \"File:Las_Meninas,_by_Diego_Velázquez,_from_Prado_in_Google_Earth.jpg\" colour bottom"
teaches: ["art-history/compositional-perspective","concepts/viewer-positioning","art-analysis/symbolism-and-iconography","history/spanish-golden-age-court"]
